// ── Write-path error messages (nfc_reader.cpp / tag_*.cpp) ──────────────────
// Previously hardcoded directly in each tag_*.cpp/nfc_reader.cpp as raw
// string literals, several with ASCII "ue"/"oe"/"gross" substitutes instead
// of real ü/ö/ß — an old habit that predates this project's umlaut-capable
// extended font (see the top of this file) and, worse, meant these strings
// weren't in the one place a future translation would look. Moved here
// (still German-only, like everything else in this file) so both problems
// are fixed at once; %u-parameterized ones stay as snprintf() format
// strings at their call sites, same as before.
